{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is approached, take it and process its properties. Otherwise, approach it. Finally, perform a specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckBatteryLevel    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
